These files should be pasted into /.config folder (exept .bashrc) for it to be effective.
It is reccomended to paste .bashrc file at /home/$USER ($USER = you user name)
But before that these packages should be installed: (check packages-list file for details)

Start with system up: sudo pacman -Syu

sudo pacman -S hyprlauncher zip unzip p7zip unrar xarchiver thunar-archive-plugin file-roller nano kate base-devel blueman brightnessctl cliphist discord dosfstools easyeffects fastfetch ffmpegthumbnailer git gvfs gvfs-mtp gwenview hyprpaper linux-headers networkmanager-dmenu ntfs-3g ntfsprogs nwg-dock-hyprland nwg-drawer okular otf-font-awesome ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd pavucontrol strawberry swaync thunar ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols tumbler usbutils vlc vlc-plugins-all waybar wine woff2-font-awesome ddcutil libva-intel-driver intel-media-driver libva-utils mesa mesa-utils vulkan-intel lsp-plugins-lv2 lsp-plugins-clap gst-libav gst-plugins-good gst-plugins-bad gst-plugins-ugly cava playerctl mpd ncmpcpp errands power-profiles-daemon firefoxpwa cmus mission-center --noconfirm
        [--noconfirm skips the y/n part]

##install yay (optional)
git clone https://aur.archlinux.org/yay.git
cd yay
makepkg -si

yay -S localsend 
        [
        Some extra steps are needed. After installing localsend, paste these three lines in tarminal.
        1. sudo ufw allow 53317/tcp
	2. sudo ufw allow 53317/udp
	3. sudo ufw reload
        ]
yay -S astra-music-bin

